@jconorgrogan @austerity_sucks I think FTX US was always solvent, with segregated assets from FTX International

this wasn't a last-minute musical chairs thing

to be clear if Alameda had excess assets (+ve NAV) on FTX US at the end, *those* would likely go to FTX intl but wouldn't be counted for FTX US anyway

@cz_binance You threatened to walk at the last minute if we didn't kick in an extra ~$75m.

We did it anyway because this just made us feel more confident we didn't want Binance on our cap table.

But again, none of this is necessary.  You won.  Why are you lying about this now?
